-3.  **Convert to BSSRDFSample:** Get sampled `SubsurfaceInteraction` (`ssi`) from reservoir. Call `bssrdf.ProbeIntersectionToSample(ssi, scratchBuffer)` to get `bssrdfSample`. If `!bssrdfSample.Sp` or `!bssrdfSample.pdf`, break [S1].
